Preserve typed STUN owner dispatch and construct a cipher group in place.

Keep the existing public AddAttribute entry point, validation order and virtual
owner callbacks. A private implementation retains the fresh integrity
attribute's concrete hierarchy instead of widening it before owner dispatch.
The cipher group value parameter cannot alias its vector. In-place construction
avoids the libc++ lvalue insertion alias-adjustment path.

